flowchart LR
  USER[MMIL reviewer] -->|HTTPS existing Cognito session| UI[Static MMIL medical evidence UI]
  UI -->|/api/v1/idp/*| CF[Existing CloudFront + CloudFront WAF]
  CF -->|existing /api/* behavior| ALB[Existing dev ALB + regional WAF]
  ALB --> BFF[Existing Launchpad API BFF]
  BFF -->|validate MMIL case access| AUTH[Existing Cognito/session + org authorization]
  BFF -->|signed short-lived service context| IDPAPI[Private reusable IDP API service]

  subgraph EXISTING["Existing Launchpad dev resources · ap-south-1"]
    VPC[VPC 10.20.0.0/16
private-egress + isolated-data]
    FILES[(launchpad-dev-files
SSE-KMS + versioning)]
    RDS[(RDS PostgreSQL 17
new idp schema + idp_dev role)]
    KMS[Data KMS key]
    OPENAI[Secrets Manager
Azure OpenAI key]
    OBS[CloudWatch logs / metrics / alarms]
  end

  subgraph IDP["New Launchpad-dev-Idp ownership boundary"]
    IDPAPI -->|create scoped upload/source URL| FILES
    IDPAPI --> RDS
    IDPAPI -->|IDs only| Q[SQS launchpad-dev-idp]
    Q -. after 3 receives .-> DLQ[SQS launchpad-dev-idp-dlq]
    Q --> WORKER[Private IDP worker
1 vCPU / 2 GB · concurrency 1]
    WORKER --> FILES
    WORKER --> RDS
    WORKER --> SCAN[Approved scan interface
basic EICAR guard only in local dev]
    WORKER --> TEXT[PyMuPDF native text]
    TEXT -->|image-only page| OCR[RapidOCR ONNX
container adapter]
    TEXT --> CLASSIFY[Versioned document-type classifier]
    OCR --> CLASSIFY
    CLASSIFY --> PIPE[Configurable typed extraction pipeline]
    PIPE -->|only if approved| AZURE[Approved Azure OpenAI endpoint
pinned deployment via NAT]
    PIPE --> VALIDATE[Type + exact citation validation]
    VALIDATE --> RESULT[Primary schema fields
+ grounded additional facts]
    IDPAPI --> DISCOVERY[Private Service Connect / Cloud Map]
  end

  IDPAPI -. no public ingress .- VPC
  WORKER -. private-egress subnet .- VPC
  RDS -. isolated-data subnet .- VPC
  KMS --> FILES
  KMS --> RDS
  KMS --> Q
  KMS --> DLQ
  OPENAI -->|worker secret only| WORKER
  IDPAPI --> OBS
  WORKER --> OBS

  UI -->|pre-signed PUT / GET from IDP via BFF| FILES
  RESULT -->|generic IDP response through BFF| UI
  UI --> VIEW[Side-by-side uploaded source
and document-specific fields]

  CLI[Standalone Python package / CLI] --> PIPE
  REGISTRY[Versioned type definitions
medical first, future types by config] --> CLASSIFY
  REGISTRY --> PIPE

